  <h1>Age 16–17: Software, AI & Systems</h1>
  <p class="lead">Published on 7 February 2025 on the legacy site and attributed there to Devina, this roadmap moved from application development toward software architecture, machine learning foundations, systems programming, cloud deployment, and open-source work.</p>
