<section class="shell section"><div class="grid">
  <article class="card"><div class="tag">Software</div><h3>Application architecture</h3><p class="muted">A plan to deepen web/backend work through larger applications, API design, authentication, and relational databases.</p></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="tag">AI</div><h3>Machine learning foundations</h3><p class="muted">A staged introduction to data tools, classical machine-learning models, neural-network concepts, and simple applied AI projects.</p></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="tag">Systems</div><h3>Systems & performance</h3><p class="muted">Exposure to C++ or Rust, algorithmic optimization, parallel-computing concepts, and lower-level problem solving.</p></article>
