<section class="shell section"><div class="panel"><div class="tag">Context</div><div class="big">This was a roadmap toward capability, not a completed-skills checklist.</div><p class="muted">The new portfolio keeps the historical ambition while separating plans from verified evidence. Completed work should be linked to code, prototypes, experiments, write-ups, or demonstrations.</p></div></section>
